The '''Gold system''',<ref name="Rise" /> also known as the '''Socorro system''',<ref name="Shadow of the Sith" /> was a [[star system]]<ref name="Rise" /> located within the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] of [[the galaxy]], which consisted of the planet [[Neftali]]<ref name="Shadow of the Sith" /> and the astronomical object [[Socorro]].<ref name="Location" /> It was also the location of [[Socorro asteroid belts|asteroid belts]] with large quantities of [[doonium]] [[ore]].<ref name="Thrawn" />

